  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"98\">🎮 Xbox 360 Game – Viva Piñata: Party Animals | €5,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"304\"><strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"141\">Viva Piñata: Party Animals</strong> is een vrolijke en competitieve partygame voor de <strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"204\">Xbox 360</strong>, perfect voor gezellige avonden met vrienden of familie. De game is getest en <strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"303\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"323\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"495\">\r\n<li data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"350\">\r\n<p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"350\"><strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"339\">Platform:</strong> Xbox 360</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"391\"><strong data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"362\">Game:</strong> Viva Piñata: Party Animals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"425\"><strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"404\">Genre:</strong> Party / Mini-games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"462\">\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"462\"><strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"447\">Aantal spelers:</strong> 1–4 (lokaal)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"495\">\r\n<p data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"495\"><strong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"478\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"510\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<li data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"568\">\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"568\">Leuke en toegankelijke partygame voor alle leeftijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<p data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"601\">Veel variatie aan mini-games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"653\">Ideaal voor multiplayer met vrienden of familie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"688\">Bekende Viva Piñata-personages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"716\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"727\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"738\"><strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"738\">€ 5,99</strong></p>",
